<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Pacific Bank 6-mth net up 41pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Pacific Bank 6-mth net up 41pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  50.43   vs	  38.18</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 15.0    vs	  11.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   443.20   vs	 292.58</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    82.94   vs	  61.83</p>
<p>    Minorities    less	 0.68   vs  less   0.17</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Pacific Bank Bhd is engaged in commercial banking and related financial services.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
